      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Force of Negation is a premium free counterspell being used to counter a Preordain, a simple cantrip. This wastes both Force of Negation and the blue card exiled to pay its alternative cost. The hand contains a Goryo's Vengeance + Atraxa combo, so exiling a blue card (likely Atraxa the combo piece, Psychic Frog the fair threat, or Meticulous Archive a needed land) is an extremely steep price to stop mere card selection.",
